# Reviewed exceptions to the pre-publication audit.
#
# Format:  <path-prefix>  <rule-keyword>  # <reason>
#
# BOTH fields are required. A path-only waiver would hide every other rule on
# that path, which defeats the point of the audit.
# Waived hits are still printed; they only stop blocking.

app/src/test/         endpoint  # ConnectionConfigTest asserts how a serverUrl is displayed.
                                # The loopback address is the input to the assertion, not a
                                # shipped endpoint.
app/src/androidTest/  endpoint  # Instrumented tests bind a MockWebServer on an ephemeral
                                # port allocated at run time; nothing is hardcoded into the
                                # app.
